    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You name the deed they hoped no one would answer for. Your voice carries across the fight, and the certainty leaves their face.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Guile</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One enemy within 4 squares who hears and understands you.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Make a Guile control attack. You are the source of the Frightened condition.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>Frightened 1.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>Frightened 2.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>Frightened 2 and Slowed 1.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/name-the-reckoning.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/name-the-reckoning.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
